      "en": "Suppose he goes with someone else[NOTE:1] to the forest to cut wood and when he raises the ax[NOTE:2] to cut the tree, the ax head flies loose[NOTE:3] from the handle and strikes[NOTE:4] his fellow worker[NOTE:5] so hard that he dies. The person responsible[NOTE:6] may then flee to one of these cities to save himself.[NOTE:7]",
