      "v": 9,
      "zh": "你若谨守遵行我今日所吩咐的这一切诫命，爱耶和华―你的　神，常常遵行他的道，就要在这三座城之外，再添三座城，",
      "en": "and then you are careful to observe all these commandments[NOTE:1] I am giving[NOTE:2] you today (namely, to love the Lord your God and to always walk in his ways), then you must add three more cities[NOTE:3] to these three.",
